<title>USA: Viking Resources Intl says names CEO.</title>
<headline>Viking Resources Intl says names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viking Resources International Inc said on Tuesday that it had elected Gerald Kuhr as chairman of the board and chief executive officer during its management restructuring.</p>
<p>Kuhr, who currently serves as chairman of EPI Systems International Inc, served as president of Kuhr Technologies Inc from 1982 to 1992.</p>
<p>Viking Resources, a holding company, said Kuhr is planning to acquire a &quot;waste to energy&quot; plant in Ohio to be brought under the aegis of the company.</p>
</text>
